        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 26 at 2:48AM EDT by NWS Marquette MI</headline>
        <description>Webcams and satellite imagery show formation of widespread fog
across the eastern and central UP this morning. Locally dense fog
could reduce visibility to less than 1/4 miles at times. Drivers
should exercise extra caution this morning and use low-beam
headlights when in the fog. Fog should lift shortly after sunrise.
</description>
